[00:00.000]...
[00:19.290]Oh take a look in the mirror, you look so sad
{"对着镜子看看吧　你看起来如此悲伤"}
[00:26.150]It's so cold like that winter market we used to go
{"寒冷刺骨　就像我们曾去的冬日集市"}
[00:33.470]I don't cry anymore but I feel so hurt
{"我不再哭泣　但心依然刺痛"}
[00:40.590]So I don't need you too close to me
{"所以我不需要你靠得太近"}
[00:44.150]You don't hear me, so you said
{"你听不见我的心声　所以你这样说"}
[00:48.210]I don't know why things have changed since yesterday
{"不知为何　一切从昨天开始改变"}
[00:57.130]This could be love again
{"这或许能重燃爱火"}
[01:00.940]All I need is you
{"我需要的只有你"}
[01:04.180]Come back, I'm waiting anytime the heavy rains come
{"回来吧　每当暴雨将至我都在等候"}
[01:11.710]Still I miss days with you
{"依然怀念有你的日子"}
[01:15.230]I can't look into your face
{"我无法直视你的脸庞"}
[01:19.130]Oh feeling blue and looking back again
{"忧郁弥漫　又一次回首往事"}
[01:29.590]Please come back to me
{"请回到我身边"}
