[03:13.020]...
[03:33.500]To stay with you always
{"永远与你相伴"}
[03:38.870]You're the world to me
{"你就是我的全世界"}
[03:41.510]And dreaming on
{"继续沉醉梦境"}
[03:43.980]So you can take my sword for you
{"所以你可以为我执剑"}
[03:48.570]Oh how do you feel so fine
{"噢 你为何如此美好"}
[03:52.980]You're the world to me
{"你就是我的全世界"}
[03:56.550]And dream on
{"继续沉醉梦境"}
